but here I was a Duke graduate. You know, maybe I should be doing better than that. So I was in a sort of period of really, really not knowing what to do next. In addition to not knowing what to do next, Ken felt like he was not measuring up. He sensed the world expected more from him and his impressive college degree. He expected more from himself. He felt lost. Still looking for answers, he signed up for a workshop that was all the rage in the 1970s and early 80s. It was called the Erhard Seminars Training, or EST Training. Yeah, the EST Training was created by Werner Erhard. He's not a spiritual guru. He was

