So after the trainer told us this, people were like, what do you mean this is it? This isn't it. So it's interesting. So in this period of your life, Ken, I think you went through what a lot of young people go through. You know, you've just graduated college, you're trying your hand at different things, you're throwing darts at the wall, nothing's really sticking.

